Package: microtun-firmware-signer
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Local Package Builder <root@localhost>
Installed-Size: 7130
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34), libgcc-s1 (>= 4.2), adduser
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: Microtun firmware signing service
 HTTP service for signing Microtun firmware digests with a configured Ed25519
 signing key. It supports GitHub OAuth identities and GitHub Actions OIDC identities
 with an explicit authorization policy.
